The Mera gallery has two licenses: one for the code, one for the media.

Code: the notebooks, Project.toml and Manifest.toml files of each recipe, and TEMPLATE/.
      MIT License, the license of Mera.jl. Text below.

Media: the figures, movies and thumbnails in each recipe's media/ folder, with their sidecars,
       software.bib and ro-crate-metadata.json.
       Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC-BY-4.0):
       https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
       You may share and adapt them for any purpose, as long as you give credit: name the
       recipe's author and link to the recipe.

Each recipe's author is named in the table of README.md.

